cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "genomic-benchmarks-qc: automated quality control for genomic machine learning datasets"
abstract: >-
  Detects biases, inconsistencies and data leakage in genomic machine learning
  datasets before model training. Each check asks whether a classifier seeing
  only one feature could separate the classes, and reports a Pass, Warning or
  Fail flag with the AU-ROC behind it.
type: software
authors:
